==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Rugged Rhino Beetle}}
Rugged Rhino Beetles can be found resting on [[Tree]]s in [[Hyrule Field]] and the [[Faron Grasslands]]. [[Cooking]] one with [[Monster Part]]s in a [[Cooking Pot]] will create a [[Tough Elixir]], which will temporarily grant [[Link]] [[Defense Up]] when consumed.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> The [[Kochi Dye Shop]] accepts Rugged Rhino Beetles as an ingredient for [[Green Dye]].

When Link speaks to [[Beedle]] with at least one Rugged Rhino Beetle in his [[Inventory]], Beedle will notice and ask for it.<ref name="BotW Beedle"/> In return, he offers Link a Tough Elixir.<ref name="BotW Beedle 2"/> If Link accepts, Beedle will be happy, remarking that he is adding it to his collection.<ref name="BotW Beedle 3"/> When Link speaks to Beedle afterwards, he claims to still be excited about the Beetle.<ref name="BotW Beedle 4"/> He claims that if Link has another, he should give it to him tomorrow, as he is going to be focusing on his new Beetle for the rest of the day.<ref name="BotW Beedle 5"/> If Link refuses, Beedle believes that he misjudged Link's character.<ref name="BotW Beedle 6"/>

